  ('ng-ev-011-pathmaker', 'Upper Turret Housing (1)', 250, 'Needs a Called Shot (no penalty), or damage goes to the Main Body. Reduced to zero, sensors, optics and communications are lost and the vehicle shuts down completely.', 10),
